    <bpmn:process id="W_W374" name="W374. IT Project Intake &amp; Demand Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business unit identifies a need for a new application, major enhancement, or significant technical debt project
Frequency: As-needed (typically 5–10 major requests per month)
Volume: Managing a portfolio of ~20–30 active projects at various stages
Owner: IT Project Manager / CIO
Participants: Requesting Dept Head, IT Manager, Security Admin, Finance Controller, Legal
Source: workflow W374 — IT Project Intake &amp; Demand Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W374_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W374_Lane1" name="Dept Head">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W374_Lane2" name="IT Project Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W374_Lane3" name="IT Leads">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W374_Lane4" name="CIO + CFO + COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W374_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W374_Start6" name="Business unit identifies a need for a new application, major enhancement, or significant…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task7" name="Request Submission">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Request Submission: Dept Head submits project request via IT Intake Portal: description, business value, urgency, and rough budget
Responsible (R): Dept Head
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task8" name="Initial Triage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Initial Triage: IT Project Manager reviews for completeness, technical feasibility, and alignment with IT strategy; identifies duplicates
Responsible (R): IT Project Mgr
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task9" name="High-Level Sizing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: High-Level Sizing: IT Leads (App, Infra, Security) provide rough-order-of-magnitude (ROM) estimates for effort, cost, and timeline
Responsible (R): IT Leads
Accountable (A): IT Project Mgr
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task10" name="Business Case Development">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Business Case Development: Requesting dept and IT Project Manager co-develop business case: ROI, risks, resource requirements, and integration impact
Responsible (R): IT Project Mgr
Accountable (A): Dept Head
Duration: 4–8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task11" name="IT Steering Committee Review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: IT Steering Committee Review: CIO, CFO, and COO review prioritized backlog; approve/reject/defer based on resource capacity and business priority
Responsible (R): CIO + CFO + COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 hour (monthly)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W374_Task12" name="Resource Allocation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Resource Allocation: For approved projects, assign Project Manager and technical leads; create project in W128 Enterprise Project Management
Responsible (R): IT Project Mgr
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W374_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W374_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W374_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W374_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-322 (ensure controlled execution — Service Management (PA-27.1).) | - operational: IT Project Manager / CIO review and approval gate
Owner: IT Project Manager / CIO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
