    <bpmn:process id="W_W434" name="W434. NPC Annual DPO &amp; System Registration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual renewal date or significant change in data processing systems
Frequency: Annual
Volume: 5 Legal Entities
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Participants: CIO, IT Manager, Legal Counsel, NPC
Source: workflow W434 — NPC Annual DPO &amp; System Registration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W434_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W434_Lane1" name="IT Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W434_Lane2" name="DPO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W434_Lane3" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W434_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W434_Start5" name="Annual renewal date or significant change in data processing systems">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task6" name="System Audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System Audit: Review the current list of systems processing personal data (Loyalty, ERP, HR, CRM); identify any new systems added since last registration
Responsible (R): IT Manager
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task7" name="Data Mapping">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Data Mapping: Update the &quot;Data Inventory&quot; for each system: types of data collected, purpose of processing, and third-party recipients
Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task8" name="DPO Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DPO Verification: Verify the appointment of the DPO for the current year; ensure DPO certification is active
Responsible (R): VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task9" name="NPC Portal Update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: NPC Portal Update: Access the NPC &quot;NPCRS&quot; (NPC Registration System) portal; update the PIC and DPO details for all 5 legal entities
Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task10" name="DPS Registration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: DPS Registration: Register/Update the description of all Data Processing Systems; provide the security measures (technical &amp; organizational) in place for each
Responsible (R): DPO / IT Manager
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W434_Task11" name="Certificate Issuance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Certificate Issuance: Download and archive the NPC &quot;Certificate of Registration&quot; and &quot;Seal of Registration&quot; (NPC registration via NPCRS carries no fee, per NPC Circular 2022-04)
Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W434_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W434_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W434_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W434_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-322 (ensure controlled execution — Service Management (PA-27.1).) | - operational: Data Protection Officer (DPO) review and approval gate
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W434_Assoc14" sourceRef="W434_Annotation13" targetRef="W434_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
