    <bpmn:process id="W_W684" name="W684. Business Intelligence Report Development &amp; Governance Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business user report request; periodic report review cycle
Frequency: Ad-hoc development (~600–1,200 requests/year ≈ 50–100/month, consistent with W113&#x27;s intake); monthly report certification review; annual catalog cleanup
Volume: ~300–500 active BI report templates (most new requests are configurations of existing templates); ~600–1,200 new report requests/year (per W113&#x27;s 50–100/month); ~100–200 template retirements/refreshes per year
Owner: BI Developer
Participants: IT Business Analyst, Business Requestor (domain expert), BI Manager, Data Steward
Source: workflow W684 — Business Intelligence Report Development &amp; Governance Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W684_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W684_Lane1" name="Business Requestor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W684_Lane2" name="IT Business Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W684_Lane3" name="BI Developer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W684_Lane4" name="Data Steward">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W684_Lane5" name="BI Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W684_End16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W684_Start7" name="Business user report request; periodic report review cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task8" name="Business user submits report request via self-service portal per W616…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Business user submits report request via self-service portal per W616: specifies business question, required data elements, frequency (ad-hoc, daily, weekly, monthly), format (dashboard, tabular report, scheduled email), and target audience
Responsible (R): Business Requestor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task9" name="IT Business Analyst reviews request within 2 business days: assesses…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT Business Analyst reviews request within 2 business days: assesses feasibility (data availability in warehouse), complexity (simple query, calculated metrics, multi-source join), duplicates (check existing report catalog for 80%+ overlap), and business impact; categorizes as configuration (existing report with filters), minor (new query &lt; 4 hours), or major (multi-source with calculations &gt; 4 hours)
Responsible (R): IT Business Analyst
Accountable (A): BI Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task10" name="BI Developer develops report/dashboard: connects to governed semantic layer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: BI Developer develops report/dashboard: connects to governed semantic layer (per W113), follows visualization standards (BuildRight style guide: consistent color palette, chart types, drill-through patterns), implements row-level security per user role (store managers see own store only, regional sees region, etc.)
Responsible (R): BI Developer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 day to 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task11" name="Data Steward validates data accuracy: cross-checks report output against source…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Data Steward validates data accuracy: cross-checks report output against source system sample (10 records), verifies metric calculations match business definitions, confirms data freshness meets SLA
Responsible (R): Data Steward
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2-4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task12" name="Business Requestor performs UAT: validates report meets business need, confirms…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Business Requestor performs UAT: validates report meets business need, confirms data interpretation is correct, approves for production
Responsible (R): Business Requestor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task13" name="BI Manager certifies report: assigns certification level (Certified — validated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: BI Manager certifies report: assigns certification level (Certified — validated and governed, Self-Service — user-created, unvalidated, Deprecated — scheduled for retirement); publishes to report catalog with metadata (description, data sources, refresh schedule, owner, last validation date)
Responsible (R): BI Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task14" name="Monthly: BI Manager reviews report usage analytics: identifies unused reports…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly: BI Manager reviews report usage analytics: identifies unused reports (zero views in 90 days — candidate for retirement), popular reports needing optimization (slow query &gt; 30 sec), and reports approaching data freshness SLA breach
Responsible (R): BI Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W684_Task15" name="Annual: BI Manager conducts report catalog cleanup: retires deprecated reports…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Annual: BI Manager conducts report catalog cleanup: retires deprecated reports, updates data source references for changed schemas, consolidates overlapping reports, and updates the governed semantic layer for new business metrics
Responsible (R): BI Manager
Accountable (A): Data Steward
Duration: 5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W684_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W684_End16" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W684_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W684_Annotation17">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-322 (ensure controlled execution — Service Management (PA-27.1).) | - operational: BI Developer review and approval gate
Owner: BI Developer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
